OL,3,GNEWSAHospital stops gas and air use
OL,4,Aover safety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS hospital has suspended use of
OL,7,Fgas and air in its maternity suite over
OL,8,Fconcerns for staff safety.
OL,10,FBasildon Hospital leaders feared
OL,11,Fpersistently high levels of the gas -
OL,12,Fknown as Entonox - in the unit could be
OL,13,Fcausing health issues.
OL,15,FOther methods of pain relief would
OL,16,Fstill be available for women giving
OL,17,Fbirth, the Mid and South Essex NHS
OL,18,FFoundation Trust (MSEFT) said.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
