OL,3,GNEWSAHospital stops gas and air use
OL,4,Aover safety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move follows 121 members of staff
OL,7,Freceiving payouts totalling #735,000
OL,8,Ffrom the trust in October, due to
OL,9,Fover-exposure to the gas.
